ows and macOS. This update gives your colony more to think about between harvest and winter: food storage conditions now matter, preserved supplies help you plan ahead, and daylight changes through the year. Building projects also explain what they need, with clearer progress and more reliable construction. Keep the harvest, plan the pantry Perishable food","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T09:02:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041488","verified_at":"2026-10-25T11:29:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5057770-1847286114030237","game_id":"steam-5057770","kind":"update","title":"StoneEra Demo 0.9.16.3 — Halloween Update","summary":"Halloween has arrived in StoneEra! Update 0.9.16.3 brings pumpkins, warm lantern light and a new collection of decorations for your settlement. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46262112/ef6fe9fac200401a472fde0f74e62bfadc0a2101.png Grow your own pumpkins New Camp and House starts receive six pumpkin seeds. Plant them, let them grow for three game days without watering, then harvest pumpkins and recover a seed to plant again. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46262112/8c611416d872eab6721f99acc983c5f72de34281.png 14 Halloween ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T20:27:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030237","verified_at":"2026-10-22T01:54:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5057770-1847286114028209","game_id":"steam-5057770","kind":"announcement","title":"StoneEra Demo 0.9.16.2 — First Steps","summary":"Demo 0.9.16.2 is now available for Windows and macOS. We have added a clear, step-by-step tutorial for the first minutes after placing your camp. Mark a tree for cutting and let your Woodcutter harvest it. Build a Carpenter workbench, order planks and wait for production. Expand storage and complete your first shelter. Follow instructions and buttons that open the right menu. Objectives advance when the work is actually done. Your tutorial progress is saved. House starts recognize the workbench ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T09:40:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114028209","verified_at":"2026-10-21T14:56:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5057770-1847286114027948","game_id":"steam-5057770","kind":"announcement","title":"StoneEra Demo 0.9.16.1 — Sound & Community","summary":"This small demo update focuses on sound and feedback. Softer, warmer gameplay sound effects with better balance in busy colonies. New layered wind, rain, river, fire and waterwheel ambience. Natural footstep and animal-call pacing at higher game speeds. Refreshed UI click, confirmation and error sounds. A new Report a bug · Discord button in the main menu. Found a bug or have feedback? Join us on Discord. Thanks for helping improve StoneEra! {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46262112/a9c9fcdada70414594b9297883","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T08:04:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027948","verified_at":"2026-10-21T09:38:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5057770-1846651706696605","game_id":"steam-5057770","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Next Fest: Build Your First StoneEra Settlement","summary":"StoneEra is taking part in Steam Next Fest, and I'd love to see what you build! Start with a small camp in an editable voxel world. Guide your villagers as they gather resources, build, and research early technologies. Your first goal: smelt a copper bar. The free demo includes 12 early technologies and 11 Steam achievements, with no session timer. Save your world and keep building after reaching that first milestone. Show me your settlement Already playing? Post a screenshot in the Community Hu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T20:04:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696605","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:23:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5057770-1846651706689993","game_id":"steam-5057770","kind":"announcement","title":"StoneEra Demo 0.9.16 — Building, Weather & Colony Life","summary":"Version 0.9.16 brings a livelier settlement and more convenient construction. Residents organize building work more effectively, weather changes with the seasons, and beavers begin reshaping rivers. Camp or a ready-built house Choose a traditional camp or a wooden house with five beds, a workbench, a campfire and covered storage when creating a world. Both starts provide the same residents and supplies. The first day has clear skies, giving you time to explore and settle in. Construction and res","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T12:27:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689993","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:23:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5057770-1846651706673616","game_id":"steam-5057770","kind":"announcement","title":"StoneEra Demo 0.9.15.1 — Flow & Foundations","summary":"StoneEra Demo 0.9.15.1 — Flow & Foundations is now available for Windows and macOS. This update opens more hands-on water building in the Demo and improves how residents reach, carry out and recover from their work. Waterworks in the Demo Waterworks (W1) now unlocks the waterwheel, medium and large norias, and wooden/stone channels in the Demo. Normal worlds research W1; Creative worlds can use these items immediately. Water-lifting wheels pump three times faster, and built channels keep receivi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T08:51:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706673616","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:23:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5057770-1846018067942304","game_id":"steam-5057770","kind":"announcement","title":"StoneEra Demo 0.9.15 — Life in the Colony","summary":"Hello, settlers! The next StoneEra Demo update, 0.9.15 — Life in the Colony, brings you closer to your residents' everyday lives. Take control of a resident, watch the colony through their eyes, and give your settlement new ways to build, grow food and keep work moving. Here are the changes since 0.9.14.2. See the colony through a resident's eyes Control lets you move a resident directly with WASD and run with Shift after they safely hand off their work and cargo. Through Eyes follows a resident","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T21:23:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067942304","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:23:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5057770-1846018067934531","game_id":"steam-5057770","kind":"announcement","title":"StoneEra Demo 0.9.14.2 — Error Fix & Building Tools","summary":"Hello, settlers! 0.9.14.2 — Error Fix & Building Tools focuses on building your own plans and making everyday colony work more reliable. Here's a look at the updated Building Editor, followed by the main changes since 0.9.14.1. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46262112/2b2b180a16e8a0da233d07beddfb57b21e7908f5.gif Building Editor showcase — development footage. Building plans and the editor are very early alpha experiments: expect bugs, rough edges and changes as development continues. A clearer Building Edito","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T19:53:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067934531","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:23:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5057770-1846018067929580","game_id":"steam-5057770","kind":"announcement","title":"StoneEra Demo 0.9.14.1 — Building Plans & Languages","summary":"StoneEra Demo 0.9.14.1 — Building Plans & Languages The latest demo update adds reusable building plans, five new interface languages, and a collection of fixes and improvements. Building tools: very early alpha Building plans and the Building Editor are very early alpha experiments. Expect bugs, rough edges, and changes as development continues. These tools are still being developed and are not yet a finished building system. Create your own designs in the main menu's Building Editor, save them","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T13:06:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067929580","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:23:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5057770-1846018067925145","game_id":"steam-5057770","kind":"announcement","title":"StoneEra Demo 0.9.14 — Living World Is Now Available","summary":"StoneEra Demo 0.9.14 — Living World is now available on Steam for Windows and macOS. Update your demo and return to your settlement! {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46262112/7740eb8aca10693f579b869acc720275b164f602.png A livelier world The travelling merchant arrives by cow wagon. Barter supplies, order goods for the next visit and complete settlement requests for rewards and trust. More wildlife and varied landscapes: the world now features 20 animal species, six biome types and seasonal trees. Water and se","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T06:32:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067925145","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:23:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5057770-1845383656391487","game_id":"steam-5057770","kind":"update","title":"StoneEra Development Update — Merchant, Performance, New Biomes & Animals","summary":"Hello, settlers! Here's a quick look at what we're working on for StoneEra. Everything shown below is a work-in-progress preview. Merchant & trading We're developing the merchant and trading features, with the goal of giving your settlement new ways to exchange goods. Here's a look at the merchant and covered wagon in development: {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46262112/2d2b9f48e38a984eaa430c84ece99b3bd8a1c024.png Merchant and covered wagon — development screenshot. Optimization & performance We're working ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-04T15:16:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656391487","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:23:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5057770-1845383656389073","game_id":"steam-5057770","kind":"announcement","title":"StoneEra 0.9.13 — Technological Era: Research & an Untimed Demo","summary":"Hello, settlers! StoneEra 0.9.13 — Technological Era brings research to your colony, a refreshed interface, and a new way to play the free demo. Research grows with your settlement The new Research menu maps out 28 technologies across six branches: Food, Construction, Clothing, Metal, Waterworks and Transport. See what each discovery unlocks, which materials it needs, and what comes next. The demo includes 12 of these early technologies; later discoveries are cl